      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "SUNSET CALIGULA (2) is worth forgiving for his last effort when sixth (30.44) at this track over 520m. Solid record here at the distance winning nine races. Better than the latest effort and deserves another chance. ICONIC JET (3) scored two back in the quickest time on the program then drifted back and missed the frame latest finishing a 5.5 lengths 5th at this track (30.34). Has a strong record out of this box with six wins and two minor placings from 11 starts. Has ability and is one of the better chances. TATTOOED BEAST (7) goes very well this course and distance starting eight times for three wins and three minors. Comes off a (30.12) win last time, scoring by 3.5 lengths in a Grade 4/5 over 520m at this track. Looks a key chance on best figures. JUNK YARD CLYDE (1) was below best last time at Mandurah (27.74) in a Grade 4/5, finishing a 1.5 lengths fourth. Has an unbeaten record from this draw, scoring three times.",
